\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-180\li180\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.\cf0  My Lord I give to you my heart,
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0 take it, for it's thine own;
\par reject it not, whatever be
\par it is my gift to Thee.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-180\li180\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. However hard, make it to break
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0 and let it be soften;
\par And draw me near till I regret
\par and repent forever
\par 
\par \pard\fi-180\li180\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. My Jesus Thy righteous hand
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0 to me as a whole gift;
\par and give me everlasting life
\par never  I shall leave you.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-180\li180\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4.  It's Thou who intervene for me
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0 with you I'm victorious;
\par Thou forgave all my sinful act
\par and draw me to your side.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-180\li180\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5.  O, Holy Ghost, come to my heart,
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0 that I shall be so clean,
\par drive out the dark spot in my heart
\par and let me be so pure.
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0 
\par \pard\fi-225\li360\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  6. Help me, worship you perfectly
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0 and truthful always be .
\par Give me protection, that the world
\par cannot make me to shake.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li360\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 7\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  7. Help me to be strong in thy word
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0 and be so well composed
\par in Love and in humility
\par and do my Master's will.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li360\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 8\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  8. Forsake me not in troubled times
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0 let me be strong in faith ;
\par And let me wait so patiently;
\par Let me be comforted.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-180\li360\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 9\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  9. My God, graciously take my heart
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0 to be your own temple!
\par come, live in now and evermore,
\par \pard      this earth and in the Heav'n.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

